>
  <header class="doc-head">
    <h1>wpm: the package manager built into WinuxCmd</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      <strong>wpm is not a standalone program</strong> — it is compiled into <code>winuxcmd.exe</code>
      as a subcommand family (C++, no Node/Python/.NET runtime). Have
      <a href="/en/products/winuxcmd/">WinuxCmd</a> and you have wpm: it manages the index, download
      verification and command links, plus updates of <code>winuxcmd.exe</code> itself. Tools that
      should not be re-implemented get installed as real distributions.
    </p>
    <div class="badge-row">
      <Badge text="C++ (built into winuxcmd.exe)" tone="accent" />
      <Badge text="Windows x64 · ARM64" tone="info" />
      <Badge text={`ships with winuxcmd.exe${winuxLatest ? ` · ${winuxLatest}` : ''}`} tone="warn" />
      <Badge text="MIT" tone="muted" />
    </div>
    <p class="repo-line">
      <a href="https://github.com/unixwin/wpm-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        github.com/unixwin/wpm-source ↗
      </a>
      <span class="src">(the official index repo; stars per repo-meta.json, measured 2026-10-19:
        {stars !== null ? ` ${stars} stars` : ' —'})</span>
    </p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>Why wpm</h2>
    <p>
      Installing CLI tools on Windows usually means adding another package manager and its runtime.
      wpm trades the other way: the package manager lives inside the command set itself, and the
      package boundary is the command boundary — single-exe tools install flat; toolchains with DLLs
      install self-contained.
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（4 张卡片全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>不是外挂程序</strong>——wpm 以 C++ 实现并编译进 winuxcmd.exe 本体——没有 Node.js、Python 或 .NET 运行时依赖。</li>
          <li><strong>装的是命令，不是软件</strong>——winget/scoop/choco 管理「应用程序」；wpm 只收便携命令行工具与可搬迁工具链，装完即在 PATH 上。</li>
          <li><strong>SHA-256 是硬门</strong>——索引里每个构件带 sha256/size/urls 三元组；无校验和的远程构件拒绝安装。</li>
          <li><strong>为 shell 生态而生</strong>——niubash 的发行流水线用 wpm 预装 gawk；oh-my-niu 的环境包声明 wpm 包清单。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Core features</h2>
    <p>
      Official index of 281 packages; the sha256/size/urls triple contract; flat and shim layouts;
      hard-link entries (zero launch overhead); a schema:1 --json contract for GUI/TUI/agents; four
      mirror sources with fallback; two anti-poisoning locks; and self-update with rollback. Full
      eight-point list (Chinese):
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（八条特性全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>官方索引 281 包</strong>——wpm-source 仓维护的官方索引（schema:1）覆盖 ripgrep、fd、jq、fzf、bat、neovim、curl、wget、make、openssh、goawk、bsdtar 等便携 CLI。</li>
          <li><strong>三元组契约</strong>——每个构件必须带 sha256（64 位小写十六进制）、size（字节数）与 urls（多个则顺序尝试）。</li>
          <li><strong>flat / shim 双布局</strong>——flat 单 exe 直接进 usr\bin\；shim 载荷自包含在 opt\&lt;pkg&gt;\，卸载即删目录。</li>
          <li><strong>硬链接入口</strong>——每个命令在 bin\ 下是「指向真二进制的硬链接」，入口零启动开销。</li>
          <li><strong>--json 契约</strong>——查询类子命令输出带 schema:1 版本字段的纯 JSON。</li>
          <li><strong>四源镜像与回退</strong>——github-raw / jsdelivr / release-pinned / official-cn 按优先级自动回退。</li>
          <li><strong>防投毒两道锁</strong>——索引文件内声明的 sources 永不并入候选；wpm index update 记录 last_index_sha256。</li>
          <li><strong>自更新与回滚</strong>——wpm update winuxcmd 异步换镜像；.wpm\backup\ 自动保留最新两份回滚。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Install &amp; quick start</h2>
    <p>
      wpm has no installer of its own — it lands together with WinuxCmd. First thing after installing
      WinuxCmd: refresh the index.
    </p>
    <div class="codeblock">
      <p class="cmd-label">wpm ships built into winuxcmd.exe — install WinuxCmd (or niubash) and it is there; nothing separate to install.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="cmd-label">The four-command starter (each line's comment says what it does):</p>
    <div class="codeblock">
      <pre class="cmd"><code>{quickStart}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={quickStart} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <h3>First-run orientation</h3>
    <p>
      <code>wpm --help</code> lists every subcommand (install/uninstall/update/list/search/info/installed/
      export/restore/outdated/categories/index/source/links/clean/version). If the index is
      unreachable (<code>no reachable index source</code>), switch sources and retry with
      <code>wpm index update -s official-jsdelivr</code>; behind a proxy set <code>WPM_HTTPS_PROXY</code>
      and friends (WinHTTP auto-detects system proxies and PAC). On Chinese networks, switch straight
      to the official mirror:
    </p>
    <div class="codeblock">
      <pre class="cmd"><code>{cnMirror}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={cnMirror} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <p>
      To clear caches/staging/rollback directories: <code>wpm clean [cache|staging|backup|all]</code>;
      to replay a machine's package list: <code>wpm export &gt; profile.txt</code> then
      <code>wpm restore profile.txt</code>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Deep dive: the package model and the index</h2>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（索引结构 / 三元组 / 双布局 / --json 契约 / wpm-artifacts 全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <p><strong>索引结构</strong>：索引是一个 JSON 文件（wpm-source/index.json）：顶层 schema:1、version（如 official-2026.10.17）、updated、sources[] 与 packages[]。包记录含 name/version/description/kind/category/license/commands[] 与按平台分组的 artifacts（windows-x64 / windows-arm64）。</p>
        <p><strong>构件三元组与文件映射</strong>：每个构件必须携带 sha256（缺失即拒绝远程安装）、size 与 urls，外加显式 files 映射（from → to）。下载先算校验和再解压；缓存键 &lt;pkg&gt;-&lt;version&gt;-&lt;sha8&gt; 双校验（WinuxCmd#1154/#1157）。写侧同样严格：映射指向构件已不再携带的文件时以「extracted path not found」失败，不猜。</p>
        <p><strong>flat 与 shim 双布局</strong>：flat（默认）把映射文件直接装入 usr\bin\；shim 把载荷自包含装到 &lt;root&gt;\opt\&lt;pkg&gt;\，usr\bin\&lt;cmd&gt;.exe 是转发入口（winuxcmd-shim.exe 小转发器，分发跳数 24.5 ms → 12.1 ms）。无论哪种布局，bin\&lt;command&gt;.exe 都是指向真二进制的硬链接。</p>
        <p><strong>--json 契约</strong>：查询类子命令的输出是纯 JSON、不混人类可读文本，顶层带 schema:1 版本字段；完整契约见 wpm-source/docs/index-schema.md。</p>
        <p><strong>wpm-artifacts 与工具链层</strong>：category: "toolchain" 的语言运行时与 SDK 有四条准入（自包含便携、可搬迁、官方发布或 unixwin/wpm-artifacts 的 CI 构建镜像且 SHA-256 钉死、许可允许再分发）。GUI 应用、MSI/MSIX、服务驱动、生态包管理器本身明确出局。</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    <h3>Mirror mechanism</h3>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Built-in source</th><th>Region</th><th>Priority</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          sources.map((s) => (
            <tr>
              <td><code>{s.name}</code></td>
              <td>{s.region}</td>
              <td>{s.priority}</td>
              <td>{s.note}</td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>
      Sources fall back automatically by priority (lower number wins); <code>wpm source use</code>
      pins a favorite and <code>wpm source add</code> adds your own. The security boundary is written
      down: the candidate-source set = the built-in registry + user-added sources —
      <strong>sources declared inside the index file are never merged in</strong> (a compromised
      mirror cannot persistently inject download locations); <code>wpm index update</code> records
      <code>last_success_source</code> and <code>last_index_sha256</code>, and warns when a
      non-preferred source delivers a different index — a poisoned mirror cannot swap it silently.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Measured numbers</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Metric</th><th>Value</th><th>Source</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          factRows.map((r) => (
            <tr>
              <td>{r.metric}</td>
              <td><strong>{r.value}</strong></td>
              <td class="src">{r.src}</td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Release feed</h2>
    <p class="src-line">
      wpm has no version of its own — <strong>it ships with winuxcmd.exe</strong>, and its entries are
      recorded in WinuxCmd's changelog. The wpm-related content of the newest three versions
      (changelogs.json, fetched 2026-10-19; the full feed lives on the <a href="/en/changelog/">changelog</a>):
    </p>
    <ul class="changelog-list">
      <li>
        <strong>Unreleased (the WinuxCmd release line)</strong>
        <span>
          WSL interop paths: <code>/mnt/X/…</code> operands fold in the same shape as <code>/X/…</code>
          and <code>X:\…</code> (#1172) — every tool crossing the shared argument boundary
          (ls/du/sed/cp…) benefits at once, including toolchains installed via wpm.
        </span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>v1.1.14 (2026-10-17)</strong>
        <span>
          New <code>wpm links verify</code> (per-path report of links not running the current
          winuxcmd.exe) and the <code>winuxcmd-shim.exe</code> forwarder (24.5 ms → 12.1 ms; older
          installs switch over smoothly via <code>wpm links rebuild --force</code>); fixed
          <code>wpm update winuxcmd</code> leaving command links on the old image; rollback copies now
          keep the newest two and auto-prune (one machine had accumulated 61.8 MB; reclaimed with
          <code>wpm clean backup</code>).
        </span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>v1.1.13 (2026-10-17)</strong>
        <span>
          Files held by running processes upgrade via rename-aside: <code>wpm install --force</code>
          succeeded on a real install with 28 fsmonitor--daemon payload holders, packages intact;
          upgrades either complete or leave everything untouched (failed file names and holding
          processes reported together); <code>wpm clean staging/all</code> also clears parked
          <code>.wpm-old-&lt;pid&gt;</code> directories.
        </span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Related links</h2>
    <div class="link-cols">
      <div>
        <h3>On this site</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/en/products/winuxcmd/">WinuxCmd product page</a> — wpm's host binary</li>
          <li><a href="/en/products/niubash/">Niubash product page</a> — the release pipeline preloads gawk via wpm</li>
          <li><a href="/en/products/oh-my-niu/">Oh My Niu product page</a> — env packages declare wpm package lists</li>
          <li><a href="/en/docs/cli/">CLI &amp; flags reference</a> — includes the wpm quick-reference table</li>
          <li><a href="/en/docs/">Docs home</a> · <a href="/en/changelog/">Changelog</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>In the repo</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/unixwin/wpm-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub: unixwin/wpm-source ↗</a> (the official index repo)</li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/unixwin/wpm-source/blob/main/docs/index-schema.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">index.json &amp; --json contract, full text ↗</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/unixwin/WinuxCmd/blob/master/DOCS/en/wpm_guide.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wpm user guide (every subcommand) ↗</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/unixwin/wpm-artifacts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wpm-artifacts: the self-hosted artifacts repo ↗</a></li>
          <li><a href="/products/wpm/" hreflang="zh-CN" lang="zh-CN">Chinese edition of this page</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <FaqSection items={productFaq} lang="en" />
</DocsLayout>

